      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did the right thing at work. i spoke up about the fraud and now i've lost everything. no job, no friends, even my family thinks i'm the problem for \"causing drama.\" it feels like i traded my entire life just to be right, and for what? there's nothing left for me here.",
