    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it's hard to care about \"worth\" when everything i built is gone. it's like i tried to do something good and the world just punished me for it. the more i think about it, the more it feels like the world is just fundamentally broken and there's no point in trying to find a place in it anymore. everything just feels so empty now.",
