      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of absolute finality is terrifying, but please understand that this overwhelming feeling of \"no point\" is a symptom of extreme pain, not necessarily a permanent truth. Even when the path you chose leads to devastation, it doesn't mean the entire journey is a dead end. If you are feeling that this is the only way out, please call or text 988 in the US right now; they are trained to meet you exactly where your despair is. There is help available to sit with this intense feeling until it lessens.",
